{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>吳海昕（Sofiee）原名吳凱欣，2020年於ViuTV的劇集《二月廿九》憑穿越少女角色跑出，最在在續篇《940920》戲份大減令到觀眾好失望，不過今年她在《i.Swim》還有演出，粉絲不用太擔心，吳海昕除了其精湛演技被受關注，緻樣貌更成功吸引到網民，得到「新一代清純女神」的稱呼。原來吳海昕在201...</p>\n<p>\n吳海昕（Sofiee）原名吳凱欣，2020年於ViuTV的劇集《二月廿九》憑穿越少女角色跑出，今年她在《日落下的彩虹》演出大獲好評，原來吳海昕在2014年曾參選香港小姐，由昔日的「民選港姐」到成為專業演員這條路，並不簡單。\n</p>\n<h2>吳海昕參選港姐大倒熱灶惹民憤 壓力大到暴瘦</h2>\n<p>吳海昕曾就讀香港樹仁大學英國語言文學系，在求學時期客串當模特兒拍廣告，於大學畢業後任職四年空姐，工餘時會替電影學系的同學義務演出短片及畢業作品，以一圓當演員的夢想。看完電影《狂舞派》後，認為顏卓靈非常迷人，更加肯定自己的演藝夢想。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/screen-shot-2022-03-17-at-7.32.56-pm_67541870662331c761c2d7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 原名吳凱欣，是國泰空姐，25歲參選香港小姐。（圖片來源：IG@sofiee_ng）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"578\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/screen-shot-2022-03-17-at-7.32.56-pm_67541870662331c761c2d7.png\" width=\"590\"/></a><figcaption>原名吳凱欣，是國泰空姐，25歲參選香港小姐。（圖片來源：IG@sofiee_ng）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/screen-shot-2022-03-17-at-7.38.48-pm_150272574462331dd20916d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 （圖片來源：IG@sofiee_ng）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"904\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/screen-shot-2022-03-17-at-7.38.48-pm_150272574462331dd20916d.png\" width=\"743\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sofiee_ng）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>準決賽問答：向王祖藍介紹三鞭酒 遭猥瑣追問場面尷尬</h2>\n<p>2014年港姐競選分兩晚進行，8月24日準決賽11號Sofiee要向扮作「都敏俊」的王祖藍介紹「豬大腸」以及「三鞭酒」，被王祖藍猥瑣追問「鞭」係咩意思，Sofiee勉強用英語介紹話係「Taste Good」，場面十分尷尬好在Sofiee轉數快成功過關。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1175_14308683146234267f7a40a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1175_14308683146234267f7a40a-912x1024.jpg\" width=\"912\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1174_5632166966234268103f15.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"893\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1174_5632166966234268103f15-1024x952.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1182_1628960647623426784878d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1182_1628960647623426784878d-952x1024.jpg\" width=\"952\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1181_202161366362342679f0750.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"786\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1181_202161366362342679f0750-1024x838.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1180_1892459506234267bbfd5b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"812\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1180_1892459506234267bbfd5b-1024x866.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1176_4288502706234267da4951.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1002\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1176_4288502706234267da4951-981x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1173_70065859762342682eebdb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"796\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1173_70065859762342682eebdb-1024x849.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1164_105346533962342686ca4ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"813\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1164_105346533962342686ca4ab-1024x867.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1163_59369664962342688c05d1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1163_59369664962342688c05d1-1024x910.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure>\n<h2>總決賽場面重溫：泳裝環節</h2>\n<p>成功打入10強後，在年8月31日《香港小姐2014》總決賽泳裝問答環節，吳海昕被問到「為何欣賞王祖藍」，曾志偉連番追問，搞到好尷尬。Sofiee表示王祖藍夠膽追求李亞男，係「非典型」男人，結果一輪牛頭唔搭馬嘴問答，嘻嘻哈哈草草收場。當晚港姐冠亞季軍分別為邵珮詩、王卓淇、何艷娟，當年設有投票系統，這一屆投票總參與人數為255,955人；三甲的總票數為209,988票，而45,967票的觀眾之前選了其他佳麗，在公佈大會評判3強後，未有再參與投票，流失了接近四萬六人，不少觀眾質疑邵珮詩為何能一人獨攬156,191票。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1189_201837306262342378a0e73-1024x834.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 在泳裝問答環節，吳海昕被問到為何欣賞王祖藍，曾志偉連番追問，搞到好尷尬。（圖片來源：TVB.com）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"782\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1189_201837306262342378a0e73-1024x834.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>在泳裝問答環節，吳海昕被問到為何欣賞王祖藍，曾志偉連番追問，搞到好尷尬。（圖片來源：TVB.com）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1187_1521806846235a47eb1350-1024x863.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 曾志偉問吳凱欣為何欣賞王祖藍。（圖片來源：TVB.com）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"809\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1187_1521806846235a47eb1350-1024x863.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>曾志偉問吳凱欣為何欣賞王祖藍。（圖片來源：TVB.com）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1186_11324560946235a480bfd2d-1024x890.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 Sofiee表示王祖藍夠膽追求李亞男，係「非典型」男人，結果一輪牛頭唔搭馬嘴問答，嘻嘻哈哈草草收場。（圖片來源：TVB.com）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"834\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1186_11324560946235a480bfd2d-1024x890.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Sofiee表示王祖藍夠膽追求李亞男，係「非典型」男人，結果一輪牛頭唔搭馬嘴問答，嘻嘻哈哈草草收場。（圖片來源：TVB.com）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1185_138629845862342672d75f1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"986\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1185_138629845862342672d75f1-997x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1184_77532557162342674a02a5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"889\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1184_77532557162342674a02a5-1024x948.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1183_18276333046234267674531.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"911\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1183_18276333046234267674531-1024x972.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1171_166222598362342685118e8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"670\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1171_166222598362342685118e8-1024x715.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure>\n<h2>吳海昕被TVB冷待 為圓夢隻身到紐約花光身家</h2>\n<p>在落選後的三個月，吳海昕被TVB投閒置散，未有拍過任何劇集，令她躲在家三個月，反覆思考後她認為自己落選的原因是「未夠班」，更認為要好好裝備自己。所以她離開TVB，毅然用光自己全副身家，隻身遠赴紐約進修電影表演課程。兩個多月的課程加上生活費和住宿，就花上十多萬積蓄。完成課程之後，TVB剛好舉辦新一屆香港小姐競選，善忘的觀眾似乎已經忘了她，彷彿所有努力都要從新開始。不過她為了堅守自己演員夢，只好努力，繼續拼搏。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/10986156_847207695355690_271645730_n_24818905062342cc7ace81.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 15年春天，獨自前往紐約進修演技。（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"896\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/10986156_847207695355690_271645730_n_24818905062342cc7ace81.jpeg\" width=\"640\"/></a><figcaption>15年春天，獨自前往紐約進修演技。（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/11142219_471026279711665_2055474386_n_168428880062342cc64ad9d.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 在美國認識了來自世界各地的演員，第一場吻戲的對手是來自英國的靚仔。（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"764\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/11142219_471026279711665_2055474386_n_168428880062342cc64ad9d.jpeg\" width=\"640\"/></a><figcaption>在美國認識了來自世界各地的演員，第一場吻戲的對手是來自英國的靚仔。（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>回顧吳海昕25歲選港姐志願：「成為一個可為世界帶來歡樂的表演者」</h2>\n<p>為了加入娛樂圈，她在2014年參選香港小姐競選，當時25歲的吳海昕（當時以原名吳凱欣參選）曾表示在香港小姐競選的過程中，只要有足夠勇氣面對大量觀眾，就能夠通過挑戰。雖然當年她大倒熱灶、三甲不入，只當選為「旅遊大使」，但她卻憑著親切鄰家的外表贏得「民選港姐」之稱。不少網民紛紛指斥賽果，更有人直指當年是「史上最失敗的一屆港姐」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1152_846700906623423cca50e2-1024x904.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 在準決賽的自我介紹環節，表現穩定，介紹自己來自「大埔運頭塘」，配合當年主題，自信係「土炮港姐」可以代表香港。（圖片來源：TVB.com）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"848\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1152_846700906623423cca50e2-1024x904.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>在準決賽的自我介紹環節，表現穩定，介紹自己來自「大埔運頭塘」，配合當年主題，自信係「土炮港姐」可以代表香港。（圖片來源：TVB.com）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>準決賽的自我介紹，嘉賓席上有馬國明提問，邀請Sofiee分享自己做空姐招呼麻煩客人的心得：</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1154_8013354156234268e14db8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"927\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1154_8013354156234268e14db8-1024x989.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1147_815456180623426978dc38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"797\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1147_815456180623426978dc38-1024x850.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1149_11980311786234269394354.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"845\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1149_11980311786234269394354-1024x901.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1153_3974187056234268fcfccb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"764\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1153_3974187056234268fcfccb-1024x815.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1151_15624741196234269197136.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"832\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1151_15624741196234269197136-1024x887.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1148_177254554362342695b39c1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"749\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1148_177254554362342695b39c1-1024x799.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1191_204312203462342670ddd19.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"779\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1191_204312203462342670ddd19-1024x831.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1159_18988335986234268a8ecc5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"910\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1159_18988335986234268a8ecc5-1024x971.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1164_105346533962342686ca4ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"813\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1164_105346533962342686ca4ab-1024x867.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1163_59369664962342688c05d1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1163_59369664962342688c05d1-1024x910.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1157_18844693026234268c3fb1e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"824\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/img_1157_18844693026234268c3fb1e-1024x879.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/photo_2022-03-18-14.24.28_173060826623426393b9c7-1024x762.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 11號佳麗（圖片來源：TVB.com）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"714\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/photo_2022-03-18-14.24.28_173060826623426393b9c7-1024x762.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>11號佳麗（圖片來源：TVB.com）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/photo_2022-03-18-14.24.22_1495383222623425c1124a6.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 當年的三料冠軍邵珮詩、亞軍王卓淇及季軍何艷娟，全被視作爆冷。（圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/photo_2022-03-18-14.24.22_1495383222623425c1124a6.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></a><figcaption>當年的三料冠軍邵珮詩、亞軍王卓淇及季軍何艷娟，全被視作爆冷。（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>吳海昕曾憧憬自己「一夜爆紅」</h2>\n<p>吳海昕曾坦言選港姐前憧憬自己一夜爆紅，參選後才知道要面對傳媒、觀眾、網民的批評，令她一度與其他女生比較，很大壓力，因精神緊張而暴瘦：「好少事就覺得自己做得唔夠好」但後來她終醒覺能夠參選已很幸運，失敗也是賺到。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/3_1654134878623424d005d9a.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 由面試時已獲冠以「翻版綾瀨遙」的稱號。（圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"857\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/3_1654134878623424d005d9a.jpeg\" width=\"608\"/></a><figcaption>由面試時已獲冠以「翻版綾瀨遙」的稱號。（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>重溫當年媒體的評論：</h3>\n<blockquote><p>“成個翻版綾瀨遙咁樣嘅11號吳凱欣（右圖），有氣質又清純，喺大會甄選下三甲不入，咁投票嚟做乜？所以都難怪網民會將怨氣放晒喺邵珮詩度，笑佢整容，又話佢似菲律賓人，不過都要同連奪最上鏡小姐、友誼小姐嘅冠軍邵珮詩講番句恭喜。而落選嘅翻版綾瀨遙又唔使唔開心，因為通常落選重紅過冠軍。”</p></blockquote>\n<h2>吳海昕為一個機會試鏡100次努力保持好身材</h2>\n<p>當時的吳海昕無論什麼角色，不管有沒有對白，只要有機會都會去參加選角，她亦表示「港姐」的名涵很沉重，參加選角不下100次，最終遇到一個自己十分喜歡角色—《二月廿九》Yeesa。為了以最佳的完美身形出現在觀眾面前，她曾經幾乎每晚跑步，亦有踩單車，令身材變得窈窕。</p>\n<p></p>\n<h2>吳海昕爆紅成女神爸爸感驕傲</h2>\n<p>其實吳海昕一畢業後之所以當上空姐，沒有全情投入去追夢，其實都為了父母，她認為得到一份穩定的職業才能令父母感到安心。到後來她認清自己的夢想是做演員，不惜參選港姐以展示自己的決心。</p>\n<p>其後她憑Yeesa一角爆紅，更被網民封為女神，她指父母雖然看不懂這些比較新穎的穿越劇集，但為表支持，每一集都會收看，而且吳爸爸更會提點她需要改善的地方，作出一些「看後感」，她坦言︰「爸爸係為我驕傲。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/37407008_734531623554551_2392612867695181824_n_6191011262342d9762aa5-819x1024.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 童年的Sofiee（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/37407008_734531623554551_2392612867695181824_n_6191011262342d9762aa5-819x1024.jpeg\" width=\"819\"/></a><figcaption>童年的Sofiee（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/13704084_468345166696817_2089626244_n_74494075062342d9980cfc-1024x1024.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 童年的Sofiee已經是個靚女。（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/13704084_468345166696817_2089626244_n_74494075062342d9980cfc-1024x1024.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>童年的Sofiee已經是個靚女。（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/39865254_293767364773749_1046412513303855104_n_56485457262342d9b7e56e-1024x1024.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳海昕 早前分享的童年學生相。（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/39865254_293767364773749_1046412513303855104_n_56485457262342d9b7e56e-1024x1024.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>早前分享的童年學生相。（圖片來源：ig@sofiee_ng）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>吳海昕為了成為一個出息的演員，曾付出了什麼?<i></i></p>\n<p>吳海昕當年參選港姐後被TVB投閒置散，後來花盡積蓄去到紐約進修…<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/940920-yeesa-%e5%90%b3%e6%b5%b7%e6%98%95-%e6%b8%af%e5%a7%90-iswim-plt-1282171/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1282171\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">詳情請看</a></b></p>\n<p>ViuTV《I SWIM》會開拍電影版嗎？<i></i></p>\n<p>此劇根據馮志強導演原創小說《I SWIM》改編，講述兩個青年泳手⋯⋯<b><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/iswim-%e8%a7%92%e8%89%b2-%e5%8a%87%e6%83%85%e5%8a%87%e9%80%8f-%e5%91%82%e7%88%b5%e5%ae%89-%e5%90%b3%e6%b5%b7%e6%98%95-jeffrey-plt-521302//?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=521302\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">即睇劇情劇透</a></b></p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:02:11.978042+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2623,"images":38,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T09:19:16.436301+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:44.799350+00:00","content_hash":"7a2dbc1729ff2a2a2dbe79294c919a98d93e6ed86528146133da782de7a9ac5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}